OL,3,GNEWSALeaseholders without hot water
OL,4,Athreatened with losing homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who have had no hot water or
OL,7,Fheating for more than six months say
OL,8,Fthey were told "out of nowhere" that
OL,9,Fthey could lose their homes if they did
OL,10,Fnot pay a lump sum in service charges
OL,11,Fwithin a day, along with an additional
OL,12,F"debt collection fee" of up to #1,000.
OL,14,FAbout 19 leaseholders at Admiral Court
OL,15,Fin Croydon, south London, have been
OL,16,Fwithout a gas supply since 4 March
OL,17,Fbecause of "potentially dangerous
OL,18,Fleaks".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
