OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALeaseholders without hot water
OL,4,Athreatened with losing homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC recently reported that
OL,7,Fresidents had been caught up in layers
OL,8,Fof bureaucracy over who is responsible
OL,9,Ffor paying for the remedial works.
OL,11,FFollowing this reporting, some
OL,12,Fresidents in one of the private
OL,13,Fleasehold blocks received an email from
OL,14,FGrangeford Asset Management - which
OL,15,Frepresents the freeholder - demanding
OL,16,Fpayment of the full year's service
OL,17,Fcharge in one go, despite residents
OL,18,Fhaving monthly payment agreements.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
